# 📦 SECTION 7: DEPLOYMENT

**Zip Command Template:** (adjust plugin folder / zip name to match distribution)
```bash
zip -r elementor-extras.zip . \
  -x "*/.cursorrules" -x "*/.cursor/*" \
  -x "*/.git/*" -x "*/.github/*" -x "*/.gitignore" -x "*/.gitattributes" \
  -x "*/node_modules/*" -x "*/.DS_Store" \
  -x "*/vendor/*" -x "*/assets/src/*" \
  -x "*/tests/*" -x "*/phpunit.xml" \
  -x "*/phpcs.xml" -x "*/phpcs-security.xml" \
  -x "*/.deploy-trigger" -x "*/.deploy-test" \
  -x "*.zip" -x "*.sh" -x "*.md" -x "create-plugin-zip.sh"
```

